ling conflicts due to some  projects been moving around so it is  possible that we could be getting an  announcement pretty soon they're just  trying to get everything together for it  but the thread ends with him saying I  think this was reported about a year ago  but one idea early in development was to  have Miles Morales living in Peter  Parker's apartment complex I don't know  if that stayed in the later drafts but  that is literally the only thing I've  heard about the plot of Spider-Man 4 LOL  now I'm not sure who Tom's source is I  know he's posted things in the past but  most of this sounds like it's probably  pretty accurate now of course they're  going to want Zendaya to come back she's  one of the biggest actresses in the  world plus not to mention her  relationship with Tom Holland I'm  assuming she'll want to come back to  work with him again little awkward if  she didn't but just because her Ned at  the end of Spider-Man no way home forgot  everything about Peter Parker doesn't  mean that she's going to come back I'm  still convinced that the spell is going  to be undone in some way shape or form  or Peter is simply going to tell MJ  everything that happened and she'll  somehow remember so I don't doubt that  MJ is going to return however I do doubt  John Watts returning I do not think John  Watts is going to be returning to the  MCU to direct anything anytime soon he  was originally set to direct the  Fantastic Four film which is a very very  huge deal and a project extremely close  to Kevin feige's Heart Kevin feige had  trusted him to direct that film but he  backed out because of superhero fatigue  he directed all three Spider-Man  homecoming Trilogy movies and plus not  to mention Spider-Man no way home was  probably extremely stressful for him  trying to keep all of the secrets and  direct amazing actors and bring all  three Spider-Man on the screen for the  very first time so for him to direct  that trilogy plus not to mention one of  the biggest superhero movies of all time  and then back out of another superhero  film that could have been one of the  biggest movies of all time as well  that's pretty big so I do not believe  he's coming back but as far as Miles  Morales is concerned I think that if  this is truly the last Trilogy for Tom  Holland Spider-Man Miles Morales is the  next best move he was already teased in  Spider-Man homecoming we met Prowler his  uncle who said he has a nephew which  confirmed that a Miles Morales does  exist in the MCU somewhere actually not  too far where Peter Parker lives and now  Peter Parker has moved into a new  apartment complex because well one he  doesn't really have anybody to take care  of him anymore there's no more Aunt May  no more Iron Man and happy doesn't have  any idea who he is but two he could have  probably used some Avengers connections  to get somewhat of a place but he has to  be in his own small run-down place like  we've seen him do many many times in the  comics so he can actually grow as a  character and be out on his own and the  idea of having Miles live in the same  apartment complex of him I think is  actually pretty cool either that or we  could go down the road of them  volunteering at Feast which would make  sense for Peter Parker to do because of  Aunt May so it seems like things are  seemingly set for Spider-Man 4 it looks  like Tom Holland has officially signed  on to do more films rumor has it that  the contract was for six more films  three Spider-Man films and three team-up  films so get ready for a lot more  Spider-Man in the MCU and of course like  I mentioned Deadpool now today's news  about Deadpool is pretty exciting The  Insider account who has been extremely  accurate about all the leaks she's  posted before my time to shine hello has  tweeted out Deadpool kills the fox  universe and she added Robert lifeld the  create creator of Deadpool this has been  rumored to be the story of Deadpool 3  for a while now but it looks like 